{"id":"1fcf344733aab173","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-polynomial-interpretation.md","title":"df-polynomial-interpretation","display":"df-polynomial-interpretation","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-polynomial-interpretation","aliases":["56-df-polynomial-interpretation"],"display":"df-polynomial-interpretation","depends_on":["[[56-df-polynomial-monotonicity]]","[[56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra]]"],"source_section":"6.2.9","source_pages":"187–189","source_ocr_blocks":[208,209,210],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-polynomial-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-polynomial-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-interpretation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"820f390915f7f2ba\" href=\"?note=820f390915f7f2ba\" title=\"56-df-polynomial-monotonicity\">56-df-polynomial-monotonicity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"54517e5af9b2ee4a\" href=\"?note=54517e5af9b2ee4a\" title=\"56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra\">56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.2.9"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"187–189"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>208</span><span>209</span><span>210</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}\">\\(A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。有限支撑系数族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb N^n}\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb N^n}\\)</span> 的支撑记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{supp}(c)=\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\mid c(\\alpha)\\ne0\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{supp}(c)=\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\mid c(\\alpha)\\ne0\\}\\)</span>。空乘积为 1，空和为 0。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(P_f)_{f\\in F}\">\\(P=(P_f)_{f\\in F}\\)</span> 为相应元数的整数多项式族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Poly}_n(\\mathbb Z):=\\{p\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb Z^n}\\mid\n\\exists c\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb N^n}\\;[&amp;|\\mathrm{supp}(c)|&lt;\\aleph_0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\np(\\vec x)=\\sum_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{supp}(c)}c(\\alpha)\\prod_{j=1}^n x_j^{\\alpha_j}]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolyInt}_\\Sigma(P)\\iff{}&amp;P\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}\\mathrm{Poly}_{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}(\\mathbb Z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;[\n\\mathrm{PolyClosed}_{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}(P_f\\restriction A_2^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{30mm}\\land\\mathrm{StrictPolyMono}_{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}(P_f\\restriction A_2^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)})],\\\\\nI_P(f)&amp;:=P_f\\restriction A_2^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Poly}_n(\\mathbb Z):=\\{p\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb Z^n}\\mid\n\\exists c\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb N^n}\\;[&amp;|\\mathrm{supp}(c)|&lt;\\aleph_0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\np(\\vec x)=\\sum_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{supp}(c)}c(\\alpha)\\prod_{j=1}^n x_j^{\\alpha_j}]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolyInt}_\\Sigma(P)\\iff{}&amp;P\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}\\mathrm{Poly}_{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}(\\mathbb Z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;[\n\\mathrm{PolyClosed}_{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}(P_f\\restriction A_2^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{30mm}\\land\\mathrm{StrictPolyMono}_{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}(P_f\\restriction A_2^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)})],\\\\\nI_P(f)&amp;:=P_f\\restriction A_2^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 6.2.9。用多项式函数及有限支撑系数表示，允许整数系数，之后通过 PolyClosed 和 StrictPolyMono 限制为有效解释；负系数并非一概禁止，例如 X²−X 在 A₂ 上仍有效。I_P 的定义域和输出必须按 PolyInt 约束核对，不能把整数多项式默认当作 A₂ 上的全运算。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.2.9，印刷页 187–189。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-polynomial-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"820f390915f7f2ba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-polynomial-monotonicity]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"54517e5af9b2ee4a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb N^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{supp}(c)=\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n\\mid c(\\alpha)\\ne0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P=(P_f)_{f\\in F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Poly}_n(\\mathbb Z):=\\{p\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb Z^n}\\mid\n\\exists c\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb N^n}\\;[&|\\mathrm{supp}(c)|<\\aleph_0\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\np(\\vec x)=\\sum_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{supp}(c)}c(\\alpha)\\prod_{j=1}^n x_j^{\\alpha_j}]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolyInt}_\\Sigma(P)\\iff{}&P\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}\\mathrm{Poly}_{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}(\\mathbb Z)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;[\n\\mathrm{PolyClosed}_{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}(P_f\\restriction A_2^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)})\\\\\n&\\hspace{30mm}\\land\\mathrm{StrictPolyMono}_{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}(P_f\\restriction A_2^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)})],\\\\\nI_P(f)&:=P_f\\restriction A_2^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2073,"backlinks":[{"id":"1cb07a207dad8bbd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"17f62e88bfe3bea2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-225","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-polynomial-interpretation.md]]"},{"id":"e1137f15ba0af6b3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\mathrm{PolyInt}_\\Sigma(P)$；$A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}$，$I_P$ 见 [[56-df-polynomial-interpretation]]。假设 $\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall\\beta\\in A_2^V\\;(l^{(A_2,I_P)}[\\beta]>r^{(A_2,I_P)}[\\beta])$。"},{"id":"82761b178bd1bd90","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["820f390915f7f2ba","54517e5af9b2ee4a"]}